# 📊 paper\_plots\_flowers\_ML

This directory contains all plotting scripts used to generate figures for the “Machine Learning Classification of Knots and Flower Beams” paper. Organized by plot type, it includes accuracy-vs-samples curves, stability histograms, confusion matrices, field & dot visualizations for 4‑, 5‑, and 6‑petal beams, braid diagrams, and general utilities.

---

